    "reviews": "\u201c...if you're a Resi nut like me, you may very well find this both itchy and tasty.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cI found myself glued each time I picked up Draft of Darkness.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Destructoid<br><br>\u201cThis game is brilliant, and I\u2019m likely to start another run after this full stop.\u201d<br>Vulgar Knight<br>",
